  "description": "Your Everyday Commuter eBike\n\nThe Avenue is built for riders who want to make everyday transportation simpler, more efficient, and more enjoyable. Whether you’re commuting to work, running errands, meeting friends across town, or simply choosing the bike over the car, the Avenue delivers the comfort, reliability, and confidence needed for daily use.\n\nIts upright riding position, predictable handling, and integrated electric assist create a natural riding experience that’s approachable for new riders while remaining practical enough for everyday transportation. Designed to fit seamlessly into your daily routine, the Avenue helps transform ordinary trips into enjoyable rides.\n\nPedego’s commuter-focused design combines rider comfort, dependable performance, and thoughtfully integrated technology. With UL 2271 certified batteries and UL 2849 certified electrical systems, the Avenue is engineered to provide peace of mind and reliable operation whether you’re riding across town or across the neighborhood.",
